/*****************************************************************************************************

Program Name:   TAPSSERVICE

Input       :   INBUF1

Output      :   OUTBUF1

Objective   :   This tuxedo adopter accepts the request from client, in turn fetch the required data
				from TAPS database and return the same to the client. The connection to the TAPS
				database is established at the time of booting of server in which this service is
				advertised and if required, also on each request to this service.

Author      :   Mohit Mehrotra

Date        :   27-Jul-04

Modification History:
---------------------
Ver.    Date    Author                  Details of Modifications
===========================================================================
1.0    27/07/04 Mohit Mehrotra              Initial version
1.1    05/02/06 Mohit Mehrotra              Set of code to display the service elapse time
											in milliseconds.
1.2	   26/06/06 Mohit Mehrotra				1. Under service code "02", (i.e. SWIFT payment 
											advice) the data in fields 'F_50A_NameAndAddress' 
											and 'F_59_Customer' is to be stored with new line 
											(\n) after every 35 charaters.
											2. Removing any spaces in incoming reference no.
											to service code "00", "01", "02" and "03".
1.3	   22/04/07 Mohit Mehrotra				1. Under service code "02", (i.e. SWIFT payment 
											advice) the Beneficiary Name, Address1, Address2
											and Address3 will also be stored in field 
											'F_57A_NameAndAddress' with new line (\n) after 
											every 35 charaters.
											2. 'Beneficiary Bank Clearing Code' is added under 
											service code "02". Value of this will be stored in
											'F_51A_ACCOUNTNUMBER' database table.
1.4	   02/01/08 Mohit Mehrotra				1. For SARIE/ SWIFT payment advice, Ordering Customer 
											Name, without address, has to be stored in Customer_Rem 
											field of database table BRAID_SAMA_MIS.
											2. For SARIE/ SWIFT payment advice, Beneficiary Customer
											Name, without address, has to be stored in Customer_Name 
											field of database table BRAID_SAMA_MIS
1.5	   12/07/08 Mohit Mehrotra				Amendment of language flag in SARIE Participant code
											("04") service to return language dependent Bank Name. 
1.6	   06/10/08 Mohit Mehrotra				Ordered by SARIE Participant code & Beneficiary Bank 
											country code. 
1.7	   11/11/09 Mohit Mehrotra				UTI number from TAPs for SARIE to be returned in SARIE
											payment advice message. (As requested by Zak through
											mail dated 9-Nov-2009.)
1.8	   10/04/10 Mohit Mehrotra      		Credt Card masking under PCI project.
2.0    10/05/10 B.M.Ali                  	Passwd encryption
2.1    31/07/10 Mohit Mehrotra	          	Modifications due to Itanium
2.2    30/03/2011  B.M.Ali                  Message header validation.
2.3    04/08/2012  B.M.Ali                  F_77B, beneficiary_bank_country field of braid_fpq table was populated
											during swift payment request.
2.4    14/04/2014  S. Rajesh                As User(Fahed Edris) wants to more characters to be entered in Ordering Customer name & 
											eneficiary customer name,the swift payment layout has been entirely changed.. hence, 
											created new service 10 & 11 for swift payment request in addition to service 02 & 03;
											(mail from Arul on 05-May-14 to Emerald)
2.5    18/11/2015  S. Rajesh                Remove the junk characters as per the email from Shaik Shabeer on 18NOV15.
2.6    06/11/2017  S. Rajesh                To handle UTI number if it exceeds 9999 in such a way by padding Alpha char in the first digit.
2.7    04/02/2018  S. Rajesh                To filter deplication in sarie_participant_bank by 8 digit bic_code in service "04".                             
2.8	   28/08/2018  S. Rajesh			    Modified to call Message broker and send the response for SARIE/SWIFT payment service only
*****************************************************************************************************/

